This product aggregates modules formerly published as the standalone repositories
oidf-jose, client-attestation, openid-federation, and pf-integration (each Apache-2.0,
their NOTICE files retained under {libs,servlets,plugins}/*/NOTICE), plus the pf-rar-paz-plugin,
attestation-issuer, ssf, and gm-api components.

It builds against the PingFederate SDK ("provided" scope): PingFederate is a product of
Ping Identity Corporation and is NOT included in or distributed with this repository.
